#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:8
msgid "统计"
msgstr "Statistics"

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:10
msgid "`xgl_statistics_t` 分别记录 datalink、network、transport 计数器，以及重传、CRC 错误和 RTT 指标。"
msgstr ""
"`xgl_statistics_t` contains separate datalink, network and transport counters, retransmissions, CRC "
"errors and RTT metrics."

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:12
msgid "解释"
msgstr "Interpretation"

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:14
msgid "同一个包可能计入多个协议层，不能把各层字节数相加作为应用吞吐量。提交成功和 transport TX 计数不证明远端应用已经交付；应在接收回调测量已接纳的 payload。"
msgstr ""
"A packet can appear in multiple layer counters. Do not add their byte counts to calculate application "
"throughput. Submission success and transport TX counters do not prove remote application delivery; "
"measure accepted payloads at the receiving callback."

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:16
msgid ""
"普通、原地和转发路径的 network、datalink TX 包数及字节数均在下层成功提交后累计。Network 字节表示载荷，datalink "
"字节包含帧开销；失败不计为已发送包。每次成功重传即累计重传计数，即使同一批 SACK 的后续重传失败也保留已完成计数。没有触发再次提交的重复 SACK 不增加计数。"
msgstr ""
"Network and datalink TX packet/byte counters commit only after successful lower-layer submission for "
"copied, in-place and forwarded frames. Network bytes describe payload bytes; datalink bytes include "
"framing. Failures do not count as transmitted packets. The retransmission counter increments at each "
"successful retry submission, even when a later retry in the same SACK batch fails. Repeated SACKs that "
"do not trigger another submission do not increment it."

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:18
msgid ""
"流式 parser 和原始帧入口使用相同的 CRC 分类：帧头 CRC 与完整帧 CRC 分别累加对应错误计数，并同步报告 `XGL_ERR_CRC_FAILED`。分类使用当前验证的结果，不为统计再次计算 "
"CRC。"
msgstr ""
"The streaming parser and raw-frame ingress share CRC classification: header and complete-frame CRC "
"failures increment their respective counters and synchronously report `XGL_ERR_CRC_FAILED`. "
"Classification uses the current validation result without computing CRC again for statistics."

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:20
msgid "流式恢复只记录最初拒绝候选的诊断；扫描缓存时遇到的假 magic 不重复计错。恢复出的每个完整帧分别计入接收包数和完整帧字节数。上层拒绝已通过 wire 校验的帧不会触发载荷重新同步。"
msgstr ""
"Stream recovery records the original rejected candidate once; false magic found while scanning buffered "
"bytes does not add diagnostics. Each recovered complete frame contributes its own packet and complete-"
"frame byte counts. Upper-layer rejection of a wire-valid frame does not rescan its payload."

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:22
msgid ""
"Datalink 接收统计区分帧校验与驱动调用：wire 格式/CRC 拒绝计入 `rx_errors`，CRC 另按类型报告；普通 wire 格式拒绝不额外调用错误回调，超出 datalink "
"帧长策略则报告 `XGL_ERR_INVALID_FRAME`。半帧超时重置并报告一次。PHY `rx` 回调自身返回的错误原样交给 step "
"调用方，不计作帧错误，也不重复触发协议错误回调；驱动故障计数由适配层维护。完整有效帧在调用上层前已计入 datalink 接收量，上层 BUSY 不回退该计数。TX PHY 失败则计入 datalink "
"`tx_errors` 并报告；各方向的现有含义保持明确，不把多个层次错误相加作为故障次数。"
msgstr ""
"Datalink receive statistics distinguish frame validation from driver calls. Wire format and CRC "
"rejection increment `rx_errors`; CRC also reports its category. Ordinary wire format rejection does not "
"call the error callback, while exceeding the datalink frame-size policy reports `XGL_ERR_INVALID_FRAME`."
" Partial-frame expiry resets and reports once. Errors returned by the PHY `rx` callback propagate to the"
" step caller without counting as frame errors or triggering a second protocol error callback; driver "
"fault counters belong to the adapter. A valid complete frame counts as received before upper-layer "
"admission, so BUSY does not reverse that count. TX PHY failures increment datalink `tx_errors` and "
"report the failure. These directional meanings remain explicit; adding errors across layers does not "
"yield a fault count."

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:24
msgid "发送受理边界"
msgstr "Send Admission"

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:26
msgid ""
"普通发送和两个零拷贝 API 遇到 PHY 失败时，本次提交经过的各层分别增加一次 TX 错误。这包括驱动返回 `XGL_ERR_BUSY`、`XGL_ERR_TX_FAILED` 或 "
"`XGL_ERR_INVALID_PARAM`。各层均不会把失败提交计入已发送包数或字节数。"
msgstr ""
"For ordinary sends and both zero-copy APIs, a PHY failure contributes one TX error to each layer reached"
" by that submission. This includes a driver returning `XGL_ERR_BUSY`, `XGL_ERR_TX_FAILED` or "
"`XGL_ERR_INVALID_PARAM`. No layer counts that failed submission as a transmitted packet or byte."

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:28
msgid ""
"对零拷贝发送，发送尝试从基础描述符校验通过、进入统一 network 发送路径前开始。空指针、零载荷长度、无效优先级、不支持的可靠发送和基础缓冲边界错误均在此前拒绝，不增加 TX "
"错误。受理之后，路由、MTU、精确头部空间或下层提交失败会增加 transport "
"`tx_errors`；下层仍按各自校验与提交阶段计数。不能仅凭错误码区分调用参数错误和驱动返回的错误。布局查询无论成功或失败均不构成发送尝试，详见[零拷贝](../guides/in-place-"
"send.md)。"
msgstr ""
"For zero-copy sending, an attempt starts after basic descriptor validation and before entering the "
"shared network send path. Null pointers, zero payload length, invalid priority, unsupported reliable "
"sending and basic buffer bounds fail before that point and do not increment TX errors. Once admitted, a "
"route, MTU, exact headroom or lower-layer failure increments transport `tx_errors`; lower layers retain "
"their own validation and submission counters. The error code alone cannot distinguish an invalid caller "
"descriptor from a driver's error. A layout query never counts as an attempt, whether it succeeds or "
"fails. See [Zero-Copy](../guides/in-place-send.md)."

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:30
msgid "这里的受理只表示已经开始处理逻辑发送，不代表 PHY 接纳了帧、可靠消息已入队或对端已经收到。"
msgstr ""
"Admission here means that logical sending has begun. It does not mean that the PHY accepted the frame, "
"that a reliable message was queued, or that the peer received it."

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:32
msgid "Network 计数"
msgstr "Network Counters"

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:34
msgid "下表仅说明 network 层计数。表中未列出的计数器不会因该事件更新；datalink 和 transport 可以独立记录各自处理过程。"
msgstr ""
"The following table describes network-layer counters. Unlisted counters do not change for that event; "
"datalink and transport may independently count their own processing."

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:0
msgid "事件"
msgstr "Event"

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:0
msgid "Network 计数变化"
msgstr "Network counter updates"

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:0
msgid "本地帧通过地址与安全策略检查"
msgstr "Local frame passes address and security policy"

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:0
msgid "调用 transport 前 `rx_packets += 1`、`rx_bytes += payload_len`"
msgstr "`rx_packets += 1`, `rx_bytes += payload_len`, before calling transport"

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:0
msgid "Transport 拒绝已受理的本地帧，包括 BUSY"
msgstr "Transport rejects an admitted local frame, including BUSY"

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:0
msgid "不回退 network RX 计数，也不增加 network 错误"
msgstr "No rollback of network RX counts and no additional network error"

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:0
msgid "本机发送或转发的帧被下层接纳"
msgstr "Originated or forwarded frame is accepted by the lower layer"

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:0
msgid "`tx_packets += 1`、`tx_bytes += payload_len`"
msgstr "`tx_packets += 1`, `tx_bytes += payload_len`"

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:0
msgid "转发的帧被下层接纳"
msgstr "Forwarded frame is accepted"

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:0
msgid "不增加 network RX 包数或字节数；这些 RX 计数表示本地受理"
msgstr "No network RX packet/byte increment; those RX counters describe local admission"

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:0
msgid "地址或本地安全策略拒绝帧"
msgstr "Address or local security policy rejects a frame"

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:0
msgid "`rx_dropped += 1`"
msgstr "`rx_dropped += 1`"

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:0
msgid "转发关闭、没有转发路由、TTL 到期或超出出口 MTU"
msgstr "Forwarding disabled, no forwarding route, expired TTL or exceeded egress MTU"

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:0
msgid "转发临时缓冲分配失败"
msgstr "Forwarding scratch allocation fails"

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:0
msgid "`rx_dropped += 1`、`tx_errors += 1`"
msgstr "`rx_dropped += 1`, `tx_errors += 1`"

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:0
msgid "转发进入下层后提交失败"
msgstr "Forwarding reaches the lower layer and fails"

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:0
msgid "`tx_errors += 1`；不增加已发送包数、字节数或 RX 丢弃计数"
msgstr "`tx_errors += 1`; no transmitted packet/byte or RX-drop increment"

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:0
msgid "本机逻辑发送在路由、组帧、预算检查或下层提交时失败"
msgstr "Originated logical send fails during routing, framing, budget checking or lower submission"

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:0
msgid "`tx_errors += 1`"
msgstr "`tx_errors += 1`"

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:0
msgid "内部完整帧入口因 wire 编码或实例帧长限制拒绝帧"
msgstr "Internal complete-frame entry rejects wire encoding or the instance frame limit"

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:0
msgid "`rx_errors += 1`；不增加 `rx_dropped`"
msgstr "`rx_errors += 1`; no `rx_dropped` increment"

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:49
msgid ""
"公开流式入口通常在 datalink 层拒绝非法 wire 帧，这些帧不会进入 network。最后一行说明独立的内部完整帧入口，不表示每次 datalink 拒绝还要额外增加 network "
"错误。转发节点校验 wire 帧，不在本地认证过境载荷；最终端点执行自身的安全策略。"
msgstr ""
"Public streaming ingress normally rejects invalid wire frames in datalink before they reach network. The"
" last row describes the independent internal complete-frame entry; it does not add a second network "
"error to every datalink rejection. Forwarders validate the wire frame but do not authenticate transit "
"payloads locally; the final endpoint applies its own security policy."

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:51
msgid "访问"
msgstr "Access"

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:53
msgid ""
"调用 `xgl_stats_get()` 或 `xgl_stats_reset()` 时，应用必须独占该实例。协议不提供内部 mutex 或原子快照保证。重置计数器不会重置 "
"peer、包序号、会话或待处理数据。"
msgstr ""
"Call `xgl_stats_get()` or `xgl_stats_reset()` while holding the application's exclusive access to the "
"instance. There are no protocol mutexes or atomic snapshot promises. Counter reset does not reset peers,"
" packet numbers, sessions or pending data."

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:55
msgid "编译配置"
msgstr "Build profiles"

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:57
msgid ""
"Full、Embedded 和 Embedded-lite 启用 `XGL_FEATURE_STATISTICS`。Boot 关闭统计对象及计数更新；有效实例上的 `xgl_stats_get()` / "
"`xgl_stats_reset()` 返回 `XGL_ERR_UNSUPPORTED`，获取函数不改写输出。空指针和未初始化检查仍先执行。"
msgstr ""
"Full, Embedded and Embedded-lite enable `XGL_FEATURE_STATISTICS`. Boot removes the statistics object and"
" counter updates. For a valid instance, `xgl_stats_get()` / `xgl_stats_reset()` return "
"`XGL_ERR_UNSUPPORTED`; the getter leaves its output unchanged. Null-pointer and initialization checks "
"still run first."

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:59
msgid "RTT 和内存"
msgstr "RTT and memory"

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:61
msgid ""
"RTT 只统计未重传包的有效 ACK 样本，零时间差和超出有符号时间范围的样本不参与。平均值为整数毫秒；尚无样本时平均值和最大值为零，最小值为 `UINT32_MAX`。采样计数达到 `UINT32_MAX`"
" 后停止累加观察值，协议自身的 RTO 估计仍独立更新。"
msgstr ""
"RTT observations include valid ACK samples for packets that were never retransmitted. Zero elapsed time "
"and elapsed values outside the signed time range are excluded. The mean uses integer milliseconds. "
"Before a sample, mean and maximum are zero and minimum is `UINT32_MAX`. Observations stop accumulating "
"when the sample count reaches `UINT32_MAX`; protocol RTO estimation continues independently."

#: docs/zh/reference/statistics.md:63
msgid ""
"`memory_used` 表示 `xgl_memory_requirements()` 为实例测得的完整 workspace "
"预留量，包含初始化区和各资源池；它不是载荷池当前活跃字节数。静态和分配器初始化都使用固定 workspace，因此 `memory_peak` 等于该预留量。重置统计保留这两个值，清空 RTT "
"观察值与各层计数；它不改变 RTT/RTO 控制状态。"
msgstr ""
"`memory_used` is the complete instance workspace reservation measured by `xgl_memory_requirements()`, "
"including initialization storage and resource pools. It is not the number of active payload-pool bytes. "
"Both static and allocator-backed initialization use a fixed workspace, so `memory_peak` equals this "
"reservation. Reset preserves both memory values and clears RTT observations and layer counters without "
"changing the RTT/RTO control state."
